# BaileyDataNet: formal, open technical inquiry for NVIDIA.
# Proposed by and credited to Addison McCarl.
# Intended recipient: Jensen Huang or an authorized NVIDIA review team.
# Official public corporate contact: https://www.nvidia.com/contact/ and info@nvidia.com.
# Status: a proposal and request for evaluation, not a collaboration, endorsement, or proven result.
# No message, form submission, or private contact has been sent by this repository.

